    <!-- BLANK SYSTEM SPLASH ICON — INTENTIONALLY NO LOGO (phone-verified 27 Nov 2026).
         Android 12+ circle-masks windowSplashScreenAnimatedIcon: the v11 ring sits at
         88% of the logo radius, outside the mask, so every logo icon rendered here
         came out as a big black circle with no ring and no tile — then the Compose
         splash showed the real ring tile, and the owner saw the logo twice in two
         different shapes (cold + warm launch, 4 videos). A fully opaque white icon
         keeps nonTransparentRatio == 1.0 (no fallback to the launcher icon) and is
         invisible on the white splash background under any mask, so the ring logo
         appears EXACTLY ONCE — in the Compose splash (144dp tile, white) — then Home.
         Never put the logo back in this drawable. -->
    <path
        android:fillColor="#FFFFFFFF"
        android:pathData="M0,0h288v288h-288z" />

</vector>
